    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Original focus fixtures \u2014 MIT",
      "description": "Original 16-bit RGB coupon, projects and generator under the repository's MIT license. Complementary captures share an equally sharp overlap. Independent truth is the unblurred coupon. Reliable pixels fuse; ambiguous pixels keep the anchor and index -1. The selected interior must match truth exactly. The registration project shifts the second capture by [2,-1] and applies ordinary ECC using the shared sharp registration region. Its evaluation region excludes resampling gaps and scoring halos. Focus index is not calibrated depth. OpenCV reference: https://docs.opencv.org/5.0/main_modules/imgproc_filter.html",
      "parameters": {},
      "position": [
        -500.0,
        -350.0
      ],
